"value" [:answer.type/math "r=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]+t[\\begin{aligned}6 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -7\\end{aligned}],\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/state.json" "file_sha256" "e6ec74c8d713ea023b21b4557edf499e22c8c80eb1d930a4730d1dab613f951b" "basis" 1493 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-126458" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "r=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}]+t[\\begin{aligned}-6 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 7\\end{aligned}],\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/state.json" "file_sha256" "e6ec74c8d713ea023b21b4557edf499e22c8c80eb1d930a4730d1dab613f951b" "basis" 1493 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-126458" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "r=[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]+t[\\begin{aligned}-6 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 7\\end{aligned}],\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/state.json" "file_sha256" "e6ec74c8d713ea023b21b4557edf499e22c8c80eb1d930a4730d1dab613f951b" "basis" 1493 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-126458" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "r=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]+t[\\begin{aligned}-6 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 7\\end{aligned}],\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/state.json" "file_sha256" "e6ec74c8d713ea023b21b4557edf499e22c8c80eb1d930a4730d1dab613f951b" "basis" 1493 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-77442" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Consider the straight line that passes through $P(4,0,-1)$ and is parallel to $v=⟨2,-6,3⟩.$ Find all the possible points $A$ on that line such that $PA=7.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/state.json" "file_sha256" "e6ec74c8d713ea023b21b4557edf499e22c8c80eb1d930a4730d1dab613f951b" "basis" 1493 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-77442" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we find the vector equation of the line, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r & =p+tv \\\\ r & =⟨4,0,-1⟩+t⟨2,-6,3⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).$\n\nSince $A$ lies on the line, we know that there must be a real number $t$ such that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{OA} & =⟨4,0,-1⟩+t⟨2,-6,3⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{PA} & =\\overset{\\to }{OA}-\\overset{\\to }{OP} \\\\  & =(⟨4,0,-1⟩+t⟨2,-6,3⟩)-⟨4,0,-1⟩ \\\\  & =t\\,⟨2,-6,3⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2t,\\,-6t,\\,3t⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the fact that $PA=7,$ we get:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}PA & =7 \\\\ |\\overset{\\to }{PA}| & =7 \\\\ |⟨2t,\\,-6t,\\,3t⟩| & =7 \\\\ \\sqrt{(2t)^{2}+(-6t)^{2}+(3t)^{2}} & =7 \\\\ \\sqrt{49{t}^{2}} & =7 \\\\ \\pm 7t & =7 \\\\ t & =\\pm 1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, putting the values $t=\\pm 1$ into the equation for the line, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\overset{\\to }{O{A}_{1}}=⟨4,0,-1⟩+⟨2,-6,3⟩=⟨6,-6,2⟩, \\\\  & \\overset{\\to }{O{A}_{2}}=⟨4,0,-1⟩-⟨2,-6,3⟩=⟨2,6,-4⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the points are ${A}_{1}(6,-6,2)$ and ${A}_{2}(2,6,-4).$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/state.json" "file_sha256" "e6ec74c8d713ea023b21b4557edf499e22c8c80eb1d930a4730d1dab613f951b" "basis" 1493 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-77442" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "c73d23bd8bda3653a2c735d25fd3f39c83e31fe3e1d881dcf365dcf8cc58b635" "basis" 1493 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-77442" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/state.json" "file_sha256" "e6ec74c8d713ea023b21b4557edf499e22c8c80eb1d930a4730d1dab613f951b" "basis" 1493 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-77442" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/text "${A}_{1}(10,2,2)$ and ${A}_{2}(2,6,-4)$"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/state.json" "file_sha256" "e6ec74c8d713ea023b21b4557edf499e22c8c80eb1d930a4730d1dab613f951b" "basis" 1493 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-77442" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/text "${A}_{1}(10,2,2)$ and ${A}_{2}(7,6,-3)$"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/state.json" "file_sha256" "e6ec74c8d713ea023b21b4557edf499e22c8c80eb1d930a4730d1dab613f951b" "basis" 1493 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-77442" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/text "${A}_{1}(6,-6,2)$ and ${A}_{2}(10,18,8)$"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/state.json" "file_sha256" "e6ec74c8d713ea023b21b4557edf499e22c8c80eb1d930a4730d1dab613f951b" "basis" 1493 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-77442" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/text "${A}_{1}(6,-6,2)$ and ${A}_{2}(2,6,-4)$"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/state.json" "file_sha256" "e6ec74c8d713ea023b21b4557edf499e22c8c80eb1d930a4730d1dab613f951b" "basis" 1493 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-77442" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/text "${A}_{1}(8,-12,5)$ and ${A}_{2}(7,6,-3)$"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/state.json" "file_sha256" "e6ec74c8d713ea023b21b4557edf499e22c8c80eb1d930a4730d1dab613f951b" "basis" 1493 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-77442" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/text "${A}_{1}(6,-6,2)$ and ${A}_{2}(2,6,-4)$"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/state.json" "file_sha256" "e6ec74c8d713ea023b21b4557edf499e22c8c80eb1d930a4730d1dab613f951b" "basis" 1493 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-162173" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "The equation below gives a parametrization of the line segment $\\overset{―}{PQ},$ where $P(3,2,-1)$ and $Q(0,1,-3).$\n\n$$\nr(t)=a\\,i+b\\,j-(2t+1)\\,k,\\,t\\in [0,c]\n$$\n\nWhat is $a+b+c?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/state.json" "file_sha256" "e6ec74c8d713ea023b21b4557edf499e22c8c80eb1d930a4730d1dab613f951b" "basis" 1493 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-162173" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "We need to find a direction vector that is parallel to the given line. We can use the vector $\\overset{\\to }{PQ}$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v & =\\overset{\\to }{PQ} \\\\  & =\\overset{\\to }{OQ}-\\overset{\\to }{OP} \\\\  & =(j-3\\,k)-(3\\,i+2\\,j-k) \\\\  & =-3\\,i-j-2\\,k\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the vector equation of the line is\n\n$$\nr=p+tv\\,⟹\\,r=(3\\,i+2\\,j-k)+t(-3\\,i-j-2\\,k)\n$$\n\nand the parametrization of the line segment $\\overset{―}{PQ}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r(t) & =(3\\,i+2\\,j-k)+t(-3\\,i-j-2\\,k) \\\\  & =(3-3t)\\,i+(2-t)\\,j-(2t+1)\\,k,\\,t\\in [0,1].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\na+b+c=(3-3t)+(2-t)+1=6-4t.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/state.json" "file_sha256" "e6ec74c8d713ea023b21b4557edf499e22c8c80eb1d930a4730d1dab613f951b" "basis" 1493 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-162173" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "c73d23bd8bda3653a2c735d25fd3f39c83e31fe3e1d881dcf365dcf8cc58b635" "basis" 1493 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-162173" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/state.json" "file_sha256" "e6ec74c8d713ea023b21b4557edf499e22c8c80eb1d930a4730d1dab613f951b" "basis" 1493 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-162173" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "2t-1"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/state.json" "file_sha256" "e6ec74c8d713ea023b21b4557edf499e22c8c80eb1d930a4730d1dab613f951b" "basis" 1493 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041286/edb-impo